1
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:07,695
Now I've taken weakness as my ally

2
00:00:07,696 --> 00:00:11,347
I can fly to the highest heights

3
00:00:11,347 --> 00:00:14,130
If I would just stop here

4
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:18,782
all I've lost would lose its luster

5
00:00:18,782 --> 00:00:22,304
If you were lost out somewhere

6
00:00:22,304 --> 00:00:25,912
at the same time my heart is shaken

7
00:00:25,913 --> 00:00:28,782
I'd have no way to find you

8
00:00:28,782 --> 00:00:32,826
your kindness, or even your strength

9
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:38,521
I know.

10
00:00:38,521 --> 00:00:40,391
It's time for the dawn!

11
00:00:40,478 --> 00:00:43,782
My peak performance

12
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:47,826
blow straight past in a blast, yeah

13
00:00:47,826 --> 00:00:50,608
You'll be left frozen with laughs

14
00:00:50,608 --> 00:00:55,043
The days of pain left in the past, let's hope

15
00:00:55,043 --> 00:00:57,869
As Imake foes of the world

16
00:00:57,869 --> 00:01:02,304
I'm bracing myself upon shaking legs, yeah

17
00:01:02,304 --> 00:01:05,043
Just keep me going for a few more steps

18
00:01:05,043 --> 00:01:09,912
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

19
00:01:19,521 --> 00:01:24,478
Now, this is the comeback the time to awaken is now

20
00:01:49,826 --> 00:01:56,739
The sky, dark and foreboding...

21
00:02:02,739 --> 00:02:09,478
...as the storm intensifies!

22
00:02:11,608 --> 00:02:17,695
Across Onigashima...

23
00:02:22,913 --> 00:02:27,261
...the Blue Dragon's bellow!

24
00:02:28,043 --> 00:02:33,912
The mad howling of a legion of beasts!

25
00:02:41,174 --> 00:02:45,478
At the Port of Habu...

26
00:02:45,782 --> 00:02:51,304
...the passing of a seasonal shower...

27
00:02:51,304 --> 00:02:57,043
...dyes the leaves
of the maple in autumn's red!

28
00:03:02,130 --> 00:03:05,608
This is a tale of loyalty,

29
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:12,696
of the retainers who risked it all
to avenge their lord, Kozuki Oden!

30
00:03:14,521 --> 00:03:18,478
Though I may lack in eloquence...

31
00:03:18,478 --> 00:03:19,217
Yes!

32
00:03:19,869 --> 00:03:20,521
Red Scabbards!

33
00:03:20,521 --> 00:03:28,260
...I shall do my best
to recount the details.

34
00:03:31,652 --> 00:03:33,043
Now...!

35
00:03:34,347 --> 00:03:37,477
Upon twilight of the day
of the Fire Festival,

36
00:03:38,565 --> 00:03:41,782
before a stormy, rain-filled night...

37
00:03:42,957 --> 00:03:45,391
Leaving behind the
boisterous Flower Capital,

38
00:03:45,391 --> 00:03:51,391
Momonosuke and his retinue make their way toward
Tokage Port, attempting to catch up to Luffy.

39
00:03:53,347 --> 00:03:54,043
Eh?!

40
00:03:54,086 --> 00:03:55,912
Are you not going out to sea, Yamato?!

41
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:59,696
Aye, I am not!
I have already told Luffy and his crew!

42
00:03:59,696 --> 00:04:02,130
So you are staying, Yamato.

43
00:04:02,217 --> 00:04:03,304
Should I not?

44
00:04:03,304 --> 00:04:06,086
Nay, 'tis reassuring
to have you here...

45
00:04:06,435 --> 00:04:10,348
But did you not say something about
making a decision earlier?

46
00:04:10,652 --> 00:04:12,086
Ah, yes....

47
00:04:12,086 --> 00:04:15,651
Oden began by traveling
across this country, did he not?

48
00:04:15,652 --> 00:04:17,522
I know so little
of the world myself!

49
00:04:17,826 --> 00:04:20,869
So I shall follow in his footsteps,
one day setting out to sea!

50
00:04:20,869 --> 00:04:22,478
That is my decision!

51
00:04:22,478 --> 00:04:23,782
What's this?!

52
00:04:23,826 --> 00:04:26,999
Luffy and his crew already
discussed this with you, Yamato?!

53
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:31,261
This angers me all the more!
They dare mock me unto the end!

54
00:04:31,696 --> 00:04:35,696
Why do they depart without bidding
either me or Kin'emon farewell?!

55
00:04:35,696 --> 00:04:36,956
Why?

56
00:04:40,435 --> 00:04:41,608
Your name?

57
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:50,043
Your father was a fool of a lord.

58
00:04:51,782 --> 00:04:55,304
Who might you be,
and what business brings you here?

59
00:04:55,826 --> 00:04:59,521
I'm Luffy.
The future Pirate King!

60
00:04:59,521 --> 00:05:01,434
You, a samurai?!
Whatta load!

61
00:05:01,435 --> 00:05:05,000
Well, I'm gonna be the Pirate King
one day, so there, knucklehead!

62
00:05:05,304 --> 00:05:11,260
Then / shall be Shogun of the
Land of Wano one day, you buffoon!

63
00:05:12,304 --> 00:05:13,956
Whuzzat, ya slimy eel?!

64
00:05:13,957 --> 00:05:15,565
Arrogant monkey!

65
00:05:15,565 --> 00:05:16,999
Who ya callin' a monkey?!

66
00:05:18,130 --> 00:05:20,913
Are you just a puppet, Momo?!

67
00:05:24,043 --> 00:05:26,390
Are you gonna just cry?!

68
00:05:27,739 --> 00:05:31,391
I wish to fell Kaido!

69
00:05:33,086 --> 00:05:34,347
Let's team up.

70
00:05:36,260 --> 00:05:37,304
An alliance!

71
00:05:37,304 --> 00:05:39,956
Luffy!

72
00:05:42,782 --> 00:05:44,260
That's right, Momo!

73
00:05:45,652 --> 00:05:46,913
You're...

74
00:05:47,739 --> 00:05:50,739
...just some topknotted runt,

75
00:05:50,739 --> 00:05:54,565
always bossin' people around
even though you're just a dumb scaredy-cat!

76
00:05:54,565 --> 00:05:56,912
Do what ya gotta to stay alive!

77
00:05:56,913 --> 00:06:01,130
I'm gonna rescue you,
no matter what!

78
00:06:03,304 --> 00:06:04,304
'Cause we're pals!

79
00:06:06,304 --> 00:06:09,304
I'll ask one more time, runt.

80
00:06:09,739 --> 00:06:11,435
What's your name?!

81
00:06:12,478 --> 00:06:13,913
Hear my name!

82
00:06:13,913 --> 00:06:16,609
Kozuki Momonosuke!

83
00:06:17,304 --> 00:06:18,956
I am...

84
00:06:18,957 --> 00:06:20,826
...the future Shogun...

85
00:06:20,869 --> 00:06:26,347
...of the Land of Wano!

86
00:06:27,217 --> 00:06:28,913
Go, Momo!

87
00:06:30,217 --> 00:06:32,782
You can fly!

88
00:06:32,782 --> 00:06:33,608
Aye!

89
00:06:35,478 --> 00:06:36,956
Go stop...

90
00:06:38,957 --> 00:06:40,217
...Onigashima!

91
00:06:43,304 --> 00:06:45,564
As for Kaido,
I'm gonna...

92
00:06:47,478 --> 00:06:48,913
...one hundred percent...

93
00:06:48,913 --> 00:06:51,609
beat him!

94
00:06:54,478 --> 00:06:56,261
We may not be the best of friends,

95
00:06:56,347 --> 00:06:59,390
but we journeyed together for so long,
and yet you feel nothing?!

96
00:07:01,130 --> 00:07:04,391
How horrible you are!
I thought you a better man than that, Luffy!

97
00:07:04,391 --> 00:07:08,304
He confuses freedom with disrespect!
Am I not right, Kin'emon?!

98
00:07:08,304 --> 00:07:10,825
You are most correct!

99
00:07:10,826 --> 00:07:14,434
If I might inquire, Momonosuke-sama,
why do you not take flight?

100
00:07:15,217 --> 00:07:15,913
Silence!

101
00:07:15,957 --> 00:07:18,957
Yes, sir!
apologize for my rudeness!

102
00:07:20,130 --> 00:07:23,782
You are the true Shogun of Wano now,
Momonosuke-sama!

103
00:07:23,782 --> 00:07:27,826
Depending on Luffy-dono's response,
it is regretful, but we may have to cut him down!

104
00:07:27,869 --> 00:07:30,391
Indeed! Such is
the way of the samurai!

105
00:07:30,478 --> 00:07:33,347
You said we were pals, Luffy!

106
00:07:33,347 --> 00:07:35,651
You needn't be so angry...

107
00:07:35,739 --> 00:07:38,522
He humiliated me!
He shall pay!

108
00:07:38,826 --> 00:07:41,260
First, I punch!
Then, bite!

109
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:43,434
And then... Ah...

110
00:07:43,478 --> 00:07:46,391
Whatever the case,
I will bring him to bear!

111
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:54,087
Next time I see you guys,
we're total enemies.

112
00:07:54,565 --> 00:07:56,608
No complaints,
not even if I murder you all.

113
00:07:57,174 --> 00:07:58,826
Nope, won't hear any from me!

114
00:07:58,826 --> 00:08:00,826
Bye, Traf!

115
00:08:00,826 --> 00:08:01,782
Shuddup.

116
00:08:01,782 --> 00:08:02,999
Whuuuuh?!

117
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,957
Later, Jaggy!

118
00:08:04,957 --> 00:08:06,696
You're next in line
to be ground meat.

119
00:08:07,913 --> 00:08:09,565
Shove off and ship out!

120
00:08:14,391 --> 00:08:16,087
Hey!

121
00:08:25,608 --> 00:08:27,651
You lot, there!

122
00:08:28,260 --> 00:08:29,956
Wait one moment!

123
00:08:30,782 --> 00:08:33,478
Hey! We came to send you off!

124
00:08:33,478 --> 00:08:35,956
Momonosuke, Kin'emon!

125
00:08:35,957 --> 00:08:37,913
Yamato-chwan!

126
00:08:41,347 --> 00:08:42,782
Luffy!

127
00:08:42,782 --> 00:08:43,608
Uweeeh?!

128
00:08:43,608 --> 00:08:45,434
I have you now!

129
00:08:45,435 --> 00:08:47,391
Luffy!

130
00:08:48,217 --> 00:08:49,695
Luffy!

131
00:08:49,696 --> 00:08:53,174
What are you thinking!!

132
00:08:53,174 --> 00:08:57,086
Leaving without a word to us,
we who have known you for longer than any other?!

133
00:08:57,086 --> 00:08:57,608
Heeh?!

134
00:08:58,391 --> 00:09:01,913
You have incensed the Shogun and myself!
Explain yourself at once!

135
00:09:01,913 --> 00:09:03,782
Well, we're meetin' now, ain't we?

136
00:09:03,782 --> 00:09:06,391
Luffy...

137
00:09:06,391 --> 00:09:08,695
By order of the Shogun...

138
00:09:08,696 --> 00:09:10,696
W-Whaddya want?

139
00:09:16,608 --> 00:09:19,347
Dod't go!

140
00:09:19,347 --> 00:09:21,956
V'll mizz you!

141
00:09:24,086 --> 00:09:27,651
Pweaze, stay with me! Forevuh!

142
00:09:27,652 --> 00:09:32,348
I do not want to be
separated from you all!

143
00:09:50,347 --> 00:09:52,912
You were the very reasons...

144
00:09:52,913 --> 00:09:54,696
...for my continued existence!

145
00:09:55,217 --> 00:09:57,087
You were the very reasons...

146
00:09:57,521 --> 00:09:59,565
...I was able to smile!

147
00:10:00,521 --> 00:10:04,912
I thank you for avenging...

148
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,304
...my father and mother!

149
00:10:08,957 --> 00:10:13,217
I am weak of mind,
and cannot find the words...

150
00:10:13,957 --> 00:10:16,304
But, I fear what is to come!

151
00:10:16,304 --> 00:10:18,434
So please, do not go!

152
00:10:19,260 --> 00:10:21,086
Kinda pathetic, huh...

153
00:10:21,086 --> 00:10:24,477
Momo-chan's still just a child...

154
00:10:27,086 --> 00:10:28,260
Usopp!

155
00:10:29,435 --> 00:10:31,174
Gotcha, it's all set!

156
00:10:31,174 --> 00:10:32,695
Catch!

157
00:10:36,391 --> 00:10:39,217
We were standin' by on the Sunny
so we could hand this over to ya!

158
00:10:39,217 --> 00:10:41,087
Some Shogun" you are, Momo!

159
00:10:41,739 --> 00:10:45,043
You might be bigger in size,
but we know who ya are on the inside!

160
00:10:45,043 --> 00:10:48,043
Yer just a stupid dumbhead scaredy-cat!

161
00:10:52,608 --> 00:10:53,217
But...

162
00:10:54,304 --> 00:10:56,738
...I think of ya
as my little brother.

163
00:11:01,086 --> 00:11:02,129
This is...

164
00:11:03,478 --> 00:11:04,521
A flag?

165
00:11:05,130 --> 00:11:08,174
When the times get tough,
just remember our adventure on the seas!

166
00:11:08,174 --> 00:11:10,565
An' fly this over Wano!

167
00:11:11,086 --> 00:11:14,129
If trouble comes knockin',
just flash this at 'em!

168
00:11:15,696 --> 00:11:21,087
If someone picks a fight with one of us,
they're pickin' a fight with all of us!

169
00:11:25,391 --> 00:11:26,391
"One of us"?

170
00:11:27,174 --> 00:11:28,826
You mean, I am one of you?

171
00:11:43,521 --> 00:11:45,956
Kin'emon, Yamato....

172
00:11:45,957 --> 00:11:47,043
Momo!

173
00:11:48,608 --> 00:11:52,999
If yous wanna be pirates,
we'll come by to pick ya up anytime!

174
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,696
And no wimps allowed!

175
00:12:03,739 --> 00:12:05,478
Set sail!

176
00:12:05,478 --> 00:12:07,391
Steady as she goes!

177
00:12:28,652 --> 00:12:30,913
I'm counting on you, Yamato!

178
00:12:30,913 --> 00:12:32,130
Mmm!

179
00:12:32,130 --> 00:12:33,434
Later!

180
00:12:33,435 --> 00:12:35,565
All the best!

181
00:12:35,608 --> 00:12:36,608
Aye!

182
00:12:36,608 --> 00:12:38,869
Hang in there, Shogun!

183
00:12:38,869 --> 00:12:41,043
Good luck, Momonosuke!

184
00:12:41,043 --> 00:12:43,477
No sobbin' from now on!

185
00:12:46,086 --> 00:12:48,738
Look after yourselves!

186
00:12:48,739 --> 00:12:50,391
We'll meet again!

187
00:12:50,391 --> 00:12:52,000
Take care!

188
00:13:25,826 --> 00:13:26,912
Kin'emon?

189
00:13:26,913 --> 00:13:27,608
Yes, m'lord?

190
00:13:27,608 --> 00:13:32,260
I shall surpass Kozuki Oden someday!

191
00:13:36,696 --> 00:13:38,174
And I shall see it through!

192
00:13:38,652 --> 00:13:39,522
Surpass me?

193
00:13:39,565 --> 00:13:40,825
No, not you!

194
00:13:47,869 --> 00:13:49,826
Okay...
To Hakumai!

195
00:13:49,826 --> 00:13:54,086
was told there's an official port
with a lift to lower ships.

196
00:13:55,521 --> 00:13:56,956
Thank goodness!

197
00:13:56,957 --> 00:14:00,652
Having climbed a waterfall to get here,
I thought we would also be plunging off!

198
00:14:05,782 --> 00:14:08,869
Ah! Straw Hat and Trafalgar...

199
00:14:08,869 --> 00:14:11,999
Usin' the official port, huh?

200
00:14:13,217 --> 00:14:18,391
Somethin' regular-ass pirates
like you oughta use!

201
00:14:18,391 --> 00:14:22,217
Cause after all,
it's nice 'n harmless!

202
00:14:25,826 --> 00:14:26,826
Harm...

203
00:14:26,826 --> 00:14:27,826
...less?

204
00:14:27,826 --> 00:14:30,652
Perfect for followers like you!

205
00:14:32,130 --> 00:14:33,695
Follow...

206
00:14:33,696 --> 00:14:34,869
...ers?!

207
00:14:34,869 --> 00:14:36,086
No, don't, Luffy!

208
00:14:36,086 --> 00:14:38,738
Harmless is good!
Don't take the bait!

209
00:14:38,739 --> 00:14:41,174
Huh?
Captain, why're you makin' that face?

210
00:14:41,174 --> 00:14:43,391
Using the official port's totally okay!

211
00:14:43,435 --> 00:14:44,782
Shaddup and just follow me!

212
00:14:44,826 --> 00:14:45,652
Got it!

213
00:14:45,739 --> 00:14:46,696
You don't got it!

214
00:14:46,739 --> 00:14:48,217
Stop the Captain!

215
00:14:48,217 --> 00:14:49,826
Jinbe, lemme take the helm!

216
00:14:49,826 --> 00:14:51,478
Don't do it, Luffyyyy!

217
00:14:51,478 --> 00:14:53,565
Captain, just don't!

218
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:14,913
The fellow rebels that Momonosuke-sama
and Kin'emon brought in tow...

219
00:15:15,478 --> 00:15:18,391
As though they were
the true Wisdom Kings,

220
00:15:18,478 --> 00:15:21,913
they raged on like typhoons!

221
00:15:23,174 --> 00:15:25,782
Neither the Dragon King, Kaido,

222
00:15:25,869 --> 00:15:29,043
nor the monstrous Oiran-fiend,
could match their fury!

223
00:15:29,086 --> 00:15:32,651
Their death throes
rent the sky asunder!

224
00:15:36,478 --> 00:15:41,304
Meanwhile, there was Orochi,
thought to have burned to death!

225
00:15:43,304 --> 00:15:48,347
Out of spite, he threw himself
upon the Princess Hiyori!

226
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,391
Slash!

227
00:15:53,086 --> 00:15:58,651
And just like that, with a single swipe of the blade,
someone cut him down...

228
00:15:59,260 --> 00:16:03,564
Twas none other than
Kozuki Oden's second disciple, Denjiro!

229
00:16:04,304 --> 00:16:06,695
And so, Orochi's remaining head
was set ablaze!

230
00:16:07,435 --> 00:16:11,695
Such was the end
of Kurozumi Orochi!

231
00:16:13,826 --> 00:16:15,652
Much like the rumbling of thunder,

232
00:16:15,652 --> 00:16:19,348
so fell Onigashima
and the Dragon King, Kaido!

233
00:16:21,347 --> 00:16:22,999
The dark clouds...

234
00:16:23,478 --> 00:16:27,391
...cast across the skies of
the Land of Wano for some twenty-odd years...

235
00:16:28,696 --> 00:16:29,391
...ever so...

236
00:16:31,217 --> 00:16:33,913
...Slowly clear away.

237
00:16:35,957 --> 00:16:42,217
With the sounds of the Flower Capital's
festival music in the distance...

238
00:16:46,565 --> 00:16:47,434
Roll!

239
00:16:49,696 --> 00:16:52,782
Burning like mad,

240
00:16:52,782 --> 00:16:57,652
Orochi, ever-glaring
in our direction, said this:

241
00:17:00,217 --> 00:17:03,869
"The Kurozumi Clan's grudge...

242
00:17:04,913 --> 00:17:12,217
"...will curse this country
for generations to come!"

243
00:17:12,217 --> 00:17:18,260
One could see the twenty years
of Wano's suffering in Princess Hiyori's eyes!

244
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:20,173
Then, her gaze of steadfastness!

245
00:17:20,652 --> 00:17:22,739
Tis dangerous, Hiyori-sama!"

246
00:17:23,304 --> 00:17:26,608
Cried Denjiro the samurai,
but she brushed him aside.

247
00:17:27,174 --> 00:17:31,391
Our beloved Princess Hiyori gave not
any quarter to the burning Orochi!

248
00:17:31,391 --> 00:17:33,869
Instead, she spoke to him his requiem!

249
00:17:34,608 --> 00:17:36,565
Fan in hand...

250
00:17:36,565 --> 00:17:38,086
...bearing the Kozuki family crest.

251
00:17:38,086 --> 00:17:41,260
She bit upon her lip,
recalling the twenty years of anguish.

252
00:17:41,782 --> 00:17:44,565
"O Father, O Mother, O Brother..."

253
00:17:44,565 --> 00:17:48,130
And she thought
of her homeland, and said!

254
00:17:48,130 --> 00:17:48,739
Yeah!

255
00:17:48,739 --> 00:17:49,782
I've been waiting for this!

256
00:17:49,869 --> 00:17:53,260
Come, dear audience!

257
00:17:54,739 --> 00:17:58,391
"If it does not burn...

258
00:17:58,478 --> 00:18:02,608
Kurozumi
"...then it is not charcoal!"

259
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:19,087
Upon twilight of the day
of the Fire Festival...

260
00:18:20,521 --> 00:18:28,651
The "Reversed Crescent Moon,"
marking the port of rendezvous

261
00:18:31,391 --> 00:18:36,782
Tis a tale of the bloody battles...

262
00:18:36,782 --> 00:18:40,608
...to take revenge, to rebuild a clan...

263
00:18:40,608 --> 00:18:52,347
...that shall be passed down
for generations to come!

264
00:18:56,608 --> 00:19:00,130
Such is the tale of...

265
00:19:01,086 --> 00:19:04,825
the return of these
legendary samurai!

266
00:19:06,304 --> 00:19:09,173
My time here today
is just about at its end!

267
00:19:09,957 --> 00:19:12,826
If you might permit me
pause for today....

268
00:19:13,521 --> 00:19:15,738
hope that we...

269
00:19:17,347 --> 00:19:19,043
...might meet again!

270
00:19:19,608 --> 00:19:21,608
Where shall we fly the flag?

271
00:20:02,782 --> 00:20:05,521
"Time's up"

272
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:10,261
Someone said again, with a laugh

273
00:20:10,826 --> 00:20:15,348
Fine then, hide-and-seek playtime...

274
00:20:16,086 --> 00:20:17,086
...is over

275
00:20:18,913 --> 00:20:22,130
Let's go, come on (We can see it soon)

276
00:20:22,435 --> 00:20:26,043
Let your heart beat out

277
00:20:27,043 --> 00:20:30,477
and things will change (We can see it soon)

278
00:20:30,608 --> 00:20:34,608
Grow strong, you have time

279
00:20:34,869 --> 00:20:35,478
Lift up that dream

280
00:20:35,739 --> 00:20:42,609
The overflowing loneliness can't sustain me alone

281
00:20:42,696 --> 00:20:46,609
We were so free in our younger days

282
00:20:46,739 --> 00:20:50,087
What a dumb dream

283
00:20:50,130 --> 00:20:51,217
...to live

284
00:20:51,478 --> 00:20:55,217
Shining a light on uncharted ways

285
00:20:55,260 --> 00:20:59,260
Get on our feet and try

286
00:20:59,478 --> 00:21:03,217
Let's see the ends of the world together

287
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:11,999
Together, we can go and fly